    "shop_smart":  [
                       "Ground beef is the priciest line here, so watch the per-pound price on the bigger packs and grab extra when it drops; it freezes clean in 1 lb portions.",
                       "Store-brand marinara does the same job as the fancy stuff, which can run several times the price, once it bakes under cheese for half an hour. Save the splurge for a dish where the sauce is the star.",
